OL,4,CHouseholds braced for soaring energy   
OL,5,Cbills with new price cap to be         
OL,6,Cannounced                              
OL,7,GDomestic energy bills are expected to  
OL,8,Gsoar in January for millions of        
OL,9,Ghouseholds, with regulator Ofgem to    
OL,10,Gannounce the precise increase shortly. 
OL,12,FA typical annual bill is predicted to  
OL,13,Frise by 26% in the new year, according 
OL,14,Fto consultancy Cornwall Insight, in a  
OL,15,Fforecast made ahead of the official    
OL,16,Fannouncement.                          
